(7117352, 1086816, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute favorite image in the challenge.  <br/>The detail is wonderful.  The lighting works well.  It''s an abstract somewhat... but can also be seen for what it is.  <br/>The angles, the way the light hits, the shadows... it all works.  <br/>The color conversion is perfect. <br/>Very well done!!!<br/>Bumping this to a 10</td>', 'This is my absolute favorite image in the challenge.  The detail is wonderful.  The lighting works well.  It''s an abstract somewhat... but can also be seen for what it is.  The angles, the way the light hits, the shadows... it all works.  The color conversion is perfect. Very well done!!!Bumping this to a 10', '2013-10-17 17:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117353, 1086607, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is my second favorite of the challenge.<br/>While the lighting is a little too harsh, I still very much enjoy this photo.  The detail is impeccable.  The rusty colors are great.  The title almost fits... if there was a little dust at the bottom of the peeling areas, that would have really set it off!  <br/>Well done.  Bumping to an 8</td>', 'This is my second favorite of the challenge.While the lighting is a little too harsh, I still very much enjoy this photo.  The detail is impeccable.  The rusty colors are great.  The title almost fits... if there was a little dust at the bottom of the peeling areas, that would have really set it off!  Well done.  Bumping to an 8', '2013-10-17 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117356, 1086593, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is my third favorite image in the challenge.  The reflections are beautiful.  The color works.  I love the way the ripples have occurred in the sand.  Beautiful.  Great shot of this challenge.  And a wonderful title to go along!  Bumping to an 8</td>', 'This is my third favorite image in the challenge.  The reflections are beautiful.  The color works.  I love the way the ripples have occurred in the sand.  Beautiful.  Great shot of this challenge.  And a wonderful title to go along!  Bumping to an 8', '2013-10-17 17:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117358, 1086541, 134859, '<td valign="top">While this may be eyelashes, I''m not fond of the macro.  There isn''t any real focus anywhere.  The colors are just flat, and I don''t enjoy the photo.  Gave this a 2</td>', 'While this may be eyelashes, I''m not fond of the macro.  There isn''t any real focus anywhere.  The colors are just flat, and I don''t enjoy the photo.  Gave this a 2', '2013-10-17 17:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117360, 1086699, 134859, '<td valign="top">Another photo I do not understand.  I don''t know what the thing is the person is holding.  Don''t understand why you''ve chosen this processing.  It''s very grainy.  And the title, I''m assuming, is a joke?<br/>I dunno.  I gave this a 2</td>', 'Another photo I do not understand.  I don''t know what the thing is the person is holding.  Don''t understand why you''ve chosen this processing.  It''s very grainy.  And the title, I''m assuming, is a joke?I dunno.  I gave this a 2', '2013-10-17 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117362, 1086829, 134859, '<td valign="top">This is a photo that I have rated low, a 3.<br/>It seems to be OOF.  I can''t really tell it''s a lightbulb.  If I look hard enough, I can see the details within the bulb.  <br/>I would have liked a cleaner, crisper photo, it would have benefited from that.</td>', 'This is a photo that I have rated low, a 3.It seems to be OOF.  I can''t really tell it''s a lightbulb.  If I look hard enough, I can see the details within the bulb.  I would have liked a cleaner, crisper photo, it would have benefited from that.', '2013-10-17 17:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7117980, 1086225, 63218, '<td valign="top">Instant fav. The colors are wonderful, but only on this Samsung monitor (which seems to have a little extra kick in the yellows). I looked at it on as many other monitors as I could find &amp; on other monitors it''s a nice shot because of the composition, but it''s the color that makes it magical IMO. I see a delicate gold, with hints of turquoise, on the water. A very subtle green in the moss on the wood. A soft glow of rose in the mud. The little red leaf. A warm white where the sun strikes the earth. I could look at this all day. I''ve looked at it for long enough to find a half-circle shape of something that looks out of place along the top border, near the corner. And the right border looks very tricky, but I like your choice. Anyway, thanks very much for this. I enjoyed it.</td>', 'Instant fav. The colors are wonderful, but only on this Samsung monitor (which seems to have a little extra kick in the yellows). I looked at it on as many other monitors as I could find & on other monitors it''s a nice shot because of the composition, but it''s the color that makes it magical IMO. I see a delicate gold, with hints of turquoise, on the water. A very subtle green in the moss on the wood. A soft glow of rose in the mud. The little red leaf. A warm white where the sun strikes the earth. I could look at this all day. I''ve looked at it for long enough to find a half-circle shape of something that looks out of place along the top border, near the corner. And the right border looks very tricky, but I like your choice. Anyway, thanks very much for this. I enjoyed it.', '2013-10-18 12:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118022, 1086156, 161988, '<td valign="top">Has anyone contacted the Department of Children and Families as of yet?</td>', 'Has anyone contacted the Department of Children and Families as of yet?', '2013-10-18 13:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
