(7118254, 1086546, 170018, '<td valign="top">Sorry, looks a little bit like "agony", not a "glory" to me. :-)<br/>They are beautiful, but clearly dying...<br/>Also feel like you''ve spent quite some time positioning them (pardon me if I''m wrong and you''ve caught the nature''s most ideal composition :-)).<br/>Nice colors!</td>', 'Sorry, looks a little bit like "agony", not a "glory" to me. :-)They are beautiful, but clearly dying...Also feel like you''ve spent quite some time positioning them (pardon me if I''m wrong and you''ve caught the nature''s most ideal composition :-)).Nice colors!', '2013-10-19 01:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
