(7120901, 1086775, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Paul, I enjoy so much your pics that you go into my "Hall of Fame". How is your life there, in that little corner of paradise? All beauty and no work I imagine! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh lovely - thank you:)<br/> <br/>Life is sweet here in rural paradise. Lots of work unfortunately as I am an IT programmer and run my own business.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Paul, I enjoy so much your pics that you go into my "Hall of Fame". How is your life there, in that little corner of paradise? All beauty and no work I imagine!   Oh lovely - thank you:) Life is sweet here in rural paradise. Lots of work unfortunately as I am an IT programmer and run my own business.', '2013-10-23 08:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
