(7150739, 1086808, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m with the other non-commenters on this one unfortunately. There''s certainly textures, and certainly materials, but it doesn''t grab me. They''re also not very pleasant textures. I can''t tell you how many splinters I''ve gotten from wood like that. Just looking at the metal makes my tongue sour (not that I''ve ever licked any... my tongue just goes sour touching old rusty metal). There''s also the texture from the dry, rough rock. Pretty much everything about the chosen textures make me want to stop looking at the photo, because they all have negative reactions to me physically.<br/> <br/>I suppose given the above bits about the texture that the afternoon, harsh sun fits right in. I suppose with all this said, it does grab me! I just don''t like how it grabs me, heh.</td>', 'I''m with the other non-commenters on this one unfortunately. There''s certainly textures, and certainly materials, but it doesn''t grab me. They''re also not very pleasant textures. I can''t tell you how many splinters I''ve gotten from wood like that. Just looking at the metal makes my tongue sour (not that I''ve ever licked any... my tongue just goes sour touching old rusty metal). There''s also the texture from the dry, rough rock. Pretty much everything about the chosen textures make me want to stop looking at the photo, because they all have negative reactions to me physically. I suppose given the above bits about the texture that the afternoon, harsh sun fits right in. I suppose with all this said, it does grab me! I just don''t like how it grabs me, heh.', '2014-01-02 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7150756, 1086604, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m going to copy and paste something I just said on <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=3936" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ambaker</a>''s photo for this same challenge:<br/> <br/>"Just looking at the metal makes my tongue sour (not that I''ve ever licked any... my tongue just goes sour touching old rusty metal). ... Pretty much everything about the chosen textures make me want to stop looking at the photo, because they all have negative reactions to me physically." <br/> <br/>His scored a 5.0130, and yours scored a 5.5658. I think the difference between the two has a lot to do with lighting. The directional lighting in your image is actually quite nice. The textures are still yucky and make me want to recoil, but the lighting is so warm and inviting. That''s an interesting contrast. <br/> <br/>I feel like I need a Tetanus shot after looking at your guys'' photos!</td>', 'I''m going to copy and paste something I just said on  ambaker''s photo for this same challenge: "Just looking at the metal makes my tongue sour (not that I''ve ever licked any... my tongue just goes sour touching old rusty metal). ... Pretty much everything about the chosen textures make me want to stop looking at the photo, because they all have negative reactions to me physically."  His scored a 5.0130, and yours scored a 5.5658. I think the difference between the two has a lot to do with lighting. The directional lighting in your image is actually quite nice. The textures are still yucky and make me want to recoil, but the lighting is so warm and inviting. That''s an interesting contrast.  I feel like I need a Tetanus shot after looking at your guys'' photos!', '2014-01-02 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7231570, 1086534, 174999, '<td valign="top">Yes, being a photographer we do see the beauty in a lot of things that other people would just pass on by... I think you have an awesome trained eye to pick up the ugly beauty.. Love how this is.. I would have given this a 10 too if I had joined earlier!</td>', 'Yes, being a photographer we do see the beauty in a lot of things that other people would just pass on by... I think you have an awesome trained eye to pick up the ugly beauty.. Love how this is.. I would have given this a 10 too if I had joined earlier!', '2014-06-21 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
