(7255894, 1086607, 50695, '<td valign="top">These subjectless photos are "mood pieces", like pieces of music with no words. The emotion is not fixed. One person can find this heartbreaking, another can find it encouraging.</td>', 'These subjectless photos are "mood pieces", like pieces of music with no words. The emotion is not fixed. One person can find this heartbreaking, another can find it encouraging.', '2014-08-27 13:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
